{"level":30,"time":1776973762435,"pid":123,"hostname":"844f2260-bff","step":"review-runs","item":"15.md","index":6,"runIndex":"run-2","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01Wi4ci8dZ4gZ45cYZB9jQbi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting - I notice that the blocks.md for Sheet 9 mentions Block 2 contains the site plan drawing showing \"utility lines, easements, existing trees, retaining walls, and surrounding properties\" but there's NO mention of setback lines or compatibility buffer lines. This is suspicious and potentially a deficiency.\n\nI also note that the Guide mentioned the site plan shows \"Building and parking data\" but nothing about setback lines.\n\nLet me now check:\n1. Sheet 2 (Plat) - should show property lines and easements\n2. Sheet 31 (Landscape Plan) - should show buffer/screening requirements\n3. Read the vision analysis for Sheet 9 to see what's actually depicted on the site plan drawing\n\nLet me check Sheet 2 first to see if setback lines are shown there.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":11,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3910,"cache_read_input_tokens":49468,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3910,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"67c41a7e-de71-427c-8abb-98ffa8658f39","uuid":"4dd832a4-da8f-4943-8079-eb7fd18085c7"}
