ject location, legal description, and establishes that the current Land Development Code applies to the project.\n   File: `01-general-information-and-applicable-codes.md`\n2. **Information Required for Vested Rights Review** (p. 1)\n   This section outlines requirements for vested rights review and includes the proposed project land use, watershed details, and the property owner's signature.\n   File: `02-information-required-for-vested-rights-review.md`\n","numLines":13,"startLine":1,"totalLines":13}}}
