o the LOC:\n    30→7\n    31→• Total number of trees with a diameter of 8 in. or greater:\n    32→47\n    33→\n    34→City of Austin | Consolidated Site Plan Completeness Check Application 10/21/24 | Page 6 of 8\n    35→\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"38ff40a3-baa1-4588-8a44-429884d301ed","uuid":"272ce647-aa5a-442e-aadc-26eb6bc158e1","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/vercel/sandbox/workspace/projects/63cead15-41f8-418c-b0ef-bd5c2b44719a/supplementary-docs/consolidated-site-plan-application/05-land-use-waivers-and-arborist-review.md","content":"# Land Use, Waivers, and Arborist Review\n\n*Details compatibility standards, requested waivers or variances, and tree counts within and adjacent to the limits of construction.*\n\nSection 10: Land Use Site Plan Data - as applicable\nSubject to Compatibility Standards? [ ] Yes [x] No\nIn Combining District/Overlay Zone? (NCCD, CVC, WO, AO, etc.): [ ] Yes [x] No\nIf Yes, please specify: \nRequires a Green Building Program Rating? [ ] Yes [x] No (If Yes, attach Letter of Intent)\n\nSection 11: Waiver / Variance / Etc. - as applicable\n[ ] Compatibility Standards Waiver – Code Section(s): \n[ ] Board of Adjustments Variance – Case Number(s): \n[ ] Driveway Spacing – Code Section(s): \n[ ] Hill Country – Code Section(s): \n[ ] Waterfront Overlay District – Code Section(s): \n[ ] Environmental – Code Section(s): \n[ ] Shared Parking Analysis [ ] Off-Site or Remote Parking\n[ ] Detention Pond Waiver [ ] Alternative Landscape Compliance\n\nSection 12: City Arborist Review\nHas there been an onsite consultation with a City Arborist? [ ] Yes [ ] No\n(If yes, please include all consultation correspondence and supporting documentation.)\nConsultation – Tree Permit Number: \nWill you be requesting a tree variance? [ ] Yes [x] No\nFor commercial site-plan applications, count trees within and adjacent to the limits of construction:\n• Number of trees with a diameter of 8 in. or greater located within the Limits of Construction (LOC):\n40\n• Number of trees with a diameter of 8 in. or greater located immediately adjacent to the LOC:\n7\n• Total number of trees with a diameter of 8 in. or greater:\n47\n\nCity of Austin | Consolidated Site Plan Completeness Check Application 10/21/24 | Page 6 of 8\n","numLines":35,"startLine":1,"totalLines":35}}}
