{"level":30,"time":1776973817679,"pid":123,"hostname":"844f2260-bff","step":"review-runs","item":"32.md","index":4,"runIndex":"run-2","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01Jntobc18UeoiTr6Kghz4eJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good. Valley View Road is not listed as a Scenic Roadway. The facts show it's a Local Street (ASMP Street Level 1). So ZLU-32.46 (Scenic Roadway signs) is NOT applicable.\n\nHowever, I see the facts mention \"Residential Design Standards (Subchapter F): Active overlay\" and it says SF-3 parcel \"triggers LDC Subchapter F compatibility standards.\"\n\nThis is important: The facts reference the OLD Subchapter F standards. But as of July 15, 2024, Article 10 replaced Subchapter F. So the facts may be outdated.\n\nLet me now evaluate the checklist items:\n\n**CRITICAL FINDING**: The facts mention \"LDC Subchapter F\" but as of July 15, 2024, the current regulation is \"Article 10 Compatibility Standards.\" The site plan should address current Article 10 requirements, not the old Subchapter F.\n\nLet me evaluate each applicable checklist item:\n\n1. **ZLU-32.1** — CBD DDBP: NOT APPLICABLE (site is MF-2, not CBD)\n2. **ZLU-32.2-32.10** — DDBP items: NOT APPLICABLE (site is MF-2, not CBD)\n3. **ZLU-32.11** — DMU setback: NOT APPLICABLE (site is MF-2, not DMU)\n4. **ZLU-32.12** — TOD density: NOT APPLICABLE (no TOD designation)\n5. **ZLU-32.13** — UNO Division 9: NOT APPLICABLE (no UNO)\n6. **ZLU-32.14** — TOD: NOT APPLICABLE (no TOD)\n7. **ZLU-32.15** — WO: NOT APPLICABLE (no WO)\n8. **ZLU-32.16** — ERC: NOT APPLICABLE (no ERC)\n\n\n9. **ZLU-32.17** — Corridor plan: NOT APPLICABLE (no corridor plan)\n10. **ZLU-32.18** — PUD/MUD: NOT APPLICABLE (no PUD/MUD)\n11. **ZLU-32.19** — CS-MU-V: NOT APPLICABLE (site is MF-2)\n12. **ZLU-32.20** — Neighborhood plan statement: NOT APPLICABLE (South Lamar NPA is SUSPENDED, no active plan)\n13. **ZLU-32.21** — Article 10 Compatibility: **APPLICABLE** - MF-2 (less restrictive than SF-3) triggers compatibility review with adjacent SF-3 parcel. This is the key requirement for the site plan.\n\n14. **ZLU-32.22** — Compatibility notes: **APPLICABLE** - Directly tied to the Article 10 analysis. 15. **ZLU-32.23** — GO/LR/CS/CS-1 lighting: NOT APPLICABLE (site is MF-2). 16. **ZLU-32.24** — On-site amenity within 25 ft: **APPLICABLE IF** Article 10 applies and amenity is within 25 ft. 17. **ZLU-32.25** — Community Recreation <300 ft: NOT APPLICABLE (no Community Recreation use). 18. **ZLU-32.26** — Outdoor noise <70dB: **APPLICABLE IF** Article 10 applies. 19. **ZLU-32.27** — VMU Neighborhood Design: NOT APPLICABLE (not VMU). 20. **ZLU-32.28** — Rain garden in amenity: **APPLICABLE IF** amenity is required.\n\nRain gardens within 25 ft of SF-3 trigger this requirement. Article 10 exception status needs verification. The project qualifies as multifamily under ZLU-32.35 given the 39 townhome units, and tenant notification requirements from the June 2022 demolition may apply under ZLU-32.36.\n\nThe remaining provisions don't apply: condominium rules don't fit since this is townhome construction, no redevelopment exception was claimed, and vesting rights aren't relevant per the Project Review Form. Trip generation limits under ZLU-32.40 warrant checking against any conditions of approval.\n\nSign compliance matters under ZLU-32.44 and ZLU-32.47—the site falls within a Nonconforming Signs Area, and Block 5 on Sheet 9 addresses signage requirements. Valley View Road isn't designated as scenic, so those restrictions don't apply.\n\nThe substantive standards requiring focus are Article 10 compatibility requirements, on-site amenities within 25 feet, outdoor noise sources, and related compatibility notes.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1262,"cache_read_input_tokens":66500,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1262,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4e7b1c1f-9804-4a61-b82e-41dbab740236","uuid":"bd0bb109-f7bc-413f-b185-900d92d44ec1"}
