{"level":30,"time":1776973819525,"pid":123,"hostname":"844f2260-bff","step":"review-runs","item":"32.md","index":4,"runIndex":"run-2","documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNum":9,"prompt":"Examine the site plan layout and identify: 1) Any on-site amenities (pools, courts, playgrounds, recreation areas) that are exclusively for residents, and their location relative to the site boundaries; 2) The location of the detention/biofiltration pond; 3) Building locations, especially those closest to the SF-3 adjacent parcel; 4) Any retaining walls or site features near the property line with the adjacent SF-3 parcel; 5) Any landscaping areas that appear to be rain gardens or bioretention features","msg":"Calling vision tool: 1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777 (9)"}
