{"level":30,"time":1776973836838,"pid":123,"hostname":"844f2260-bff","step":"review-runs","item":"16.md","index":8,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01KPrXVmf1cccX5Z2SDfqUb5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Excellent! Now I'm getting clearer information. From the vision analysis:\n\n**Sheet 9 (Site Plan):**\n- Adjacent land uses ARE shown:\n  - East: \"Lot 2, Chateaux Ridge Condominiums\" and \"Lot 1, Chateaux Ridge Condominiums\" with existing apartment buildings\n  - South: \"William James Condos, Jr.\"\n  - West: ROW with street infrastructure\n- Adjacent zoning IS shown:\n  - East: \"Zoning: MF-2-CO\"\n  - North: \"Zoning: MF-2-CO\"\n  - South & West: NO zoning labels\n- Adjacent building footprints ARE shown:\n  - East: Two existing apartment buildings shown with dashed lines\n  - North, South, West: No building footprints shown\n- Deed references and easement information shown\n\n**Sheet 1 (Cover Sheet):**\n- Shows \"ZONING MF-2\" \n- Has \"Project Location Map\" but it does NOT show adjacent zoning districts\n- Does NOT document adjacent property uses\n\nSo now I can start evaluating the checklist items:\n\n**ZLU-16.1** - Adjoining land uses noted on site plan for all surrounding properties (north, south, east, west)\n- EAST: Yes, labeled (Chateaux Ridge Condominiums / existing apartment building)\n- SOUTH: Yes, labeled (William James Condos, Jr.)\n- WEST: Partially (ROW), but not a \"property\" with land use\n- NORTH: NOT LABELED - no land use notation for north adjacent property\n- **STATUS: FAIL** - North side land use not documented\n\n**ZLU-16.2** - Adjoining land uses across adjacent streets and rights-of-way not shown\n- West is ROW/street\n- Not clear if there are adjacent uses across other streets shown\n\n\n- Need to check if the plan shows uses across the valley view road to the west or other directions\n- **STATUS: NOT CLEAR YET** - need to verify if cross-street properties are shown\n\n**ZLU-16.3** - Vacant adjoining properties not identified as \"vacant\"\n- No vacant properties appear to be labeled\n- The adjacent properties shown (Chateaux Ridge, William James, etc.) don't appear to be vacant\n- **STATUS: Cannot determine if applicable** - need to verify if any are actually vacant\n\n**ZLU-16.4** - Adjacent property zoning district designations not shown\n- East: MF-2-CO shown\n- North: MF-2-CO shown  \n- South: NOT shown\n- West: NOT shown\n- **STATUS: FAIL** - South and west zoning designations are missing from the site plan\n\n**ZLU-16.5** - Adjacent zoning designations inaccurate or inconsistent with City GIS\n- Can't verify accuracy without comparing to GIS\n- **STATUS: NOT-VERIFIABLE** - unless we verify against actual City GIS\n\n**ZLU-16.6** - Zoning district boundary lines not shown when site is subject to or abuts multiple zoning districts\n- Site is MF-2 but abuts MF-2-CO\n- Is the MF-2/MF-2-CO boundary line shown?\n- Need to check more carefully\n- **STATUS: Need to verify**\n\n**ZLU-16.7** - PUD boundaries and land use categories not shown (only if within or adjacent to PUD)\n- Site is in Mecey Subdivision, not PUD\n- Adjacent properties don't appear to be in PUD based on what's visible\n- **STATUS: Not applicable** or no PUD shown (so PASS)\n\n**ZLU-16.8** - Zoning designations not included on mylars\n- The mylars (sheets 1-39, specifically the reduced set) need to be reviewed for this requirement\n- **STATUS: Not able to verify without seeing mylars specifically**\n\n**ZLU-16.9** - Existing building footprints on adjoining properties within 50 feet not shown\n- East side shows building footprints for Chateaux Ridge apartments\n- South, north, and west sides lack building footprints—need to determine if any structures exist within the 50-foot radius on these sides\n- **STATUS: PASS for East, but need to check South and North**\n\nFor the conditional requirement about notes when no buildings exist on adjoining lots within 50 feet, I need to verify whether such a note appears for directions where no structures are present. The east side has buildings shown, so that's covered. Regarding proposed building dimensions, sheet 9 displays the buildings with dimensions provided in the Site Data tables, which appears to satisfy the requirement. The continuous perimeter boundary is the next item to evaluate.\n\nI should examine whether the building footprint perimeter is clearly marked on the site plan. After that, I'll need to look more closely at parking screening requirements, refuse setback specifications, and exterior lighting details to see if they're properly documented.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":13,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2294,"cache_read_input_tokens":58116,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2294,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e6519561-0ed8-4293-aa56-db64026a5d93","uuid":"7b77fe13-cd06-455d-9b15-9828e04f2807"}
