 Heights.\"\n    *   **Visible Features:** Trees (indicated by circles with plus signs and labels), contour lines, a fence line, and dashed lines indicating easements (e.g., \"5' P.U.E., ELEC., TELE. EASEMENT\") are shown extending slightly past the boundary line. No buildings are depicted.\n\n*   **East Side:**\n    *   **Identification:** The property is identified with the text: \"CLAWSON RIDGE CONDOMINIUMS DOC. 2017056039 O.P.R.T.C.TX.\"\n    *   **Zoning/Land Use:** No explicit zoning code is shown, but the name \"Condominiums\" implies residential use.\n    *   **Visible Features:** Contour lines, trees, and fence lines are shown immediately adjacent to the boundary. The drawing cuts off shortly after the property line. No buildings are depicted.\n\n*   **South Side:**\n    *   **Identification:** The property is identified with the text: \"(1.557 AC.) WILLIAM LANCE CONGDON, JR. VOL. 9739, PG. 583 D.R.T.C.TX.\"\n    *   **Zoning/Land Use:** No land use or zoning designation is shown.\n    *   **Visible Features:** A \"5' ELEC. EASEMENT\" is noted just outside the boundary line. Further south, there is an annotation for a found iron pipe (\"1/2\" IRON PIPE FOUND...\"). The space is otherwise blank white. No buildings are depicted.\n\n*   **West Side:**\n    *   **Identification:** The western boundary of the site fronts a public right-of-way identified as \"VALLEY VIEW ROAD\".\n    *   **Zoning/Land Use:** Right-of-way/street. No properties or zoning designations are shown across the street.\n    *   **Visible Features:** The area immediately west of the boundary shows elements of the road infrastructure, including \"CONC. CURB\" and \"ASPHALT\". No buildings are depicted across the street or within the right-of-way.","providerMetadata":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}],"finishReason":"stop","usage":{"inputTokens":1370,"outputTokens":770,"totalTokens":3779,"reasoningTokens":1639},"warnings":[],"request":{"body":{"prompt":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"f