 heavy solid lines and are dimensioned with specific bearings and distances. Based on the North arrow pointing to the right edge of the page:\n*   **Western Boundary (along road):** Consists of two segments labeled **\"N28°04'28\"E 93.20'\"** and **\"N27°29'08\"E 58.10'\"**.\n*   **Northern Boundary:** Labeled **\"S63°02'28\"E 419.96'\"**.\n*   **Eastern Boundary:** Labeled **\"S27°19'28\"W 146.15'\"**.\n*   **Southern Boundary:** Labeled **\"N63°30'57\"W 414.24'\"**.\n\n**6. The orientation and layout relative to Valley View Road**\nThe North arrow indicates North points toward the right side of the page. Therefore, **\"VALLEY VIEW ROAD\"** runs generally North-South along the Western boundary of the property. The property is roughly rectangular in shape, extending Eastward away from Valley View Road. The existing main structure (labeled **\"SLAB F.F.E.=686.8'\"**) is situated in the central/western portion of the lot, with a large paved area (labeled **\"ASPHALT\"** and **\"CONC\"**) separating the front of the structure from Valley View Road.","providerMetadata":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}],"finishReason":"stop","usage":{"inputTokens":1462,"outputTokens":1072,"totalTokens":4682,"reasoningTokens":2148},"warnings":[],"request":{"body":{"prompt":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"file","mediaType":"image/jpeg","data":"[BINARY_DATA_REMOVED - length: 1695804]"},{"type":"text","text":"# Your task\n\nYou are analyzing a subset of a real estate development site plan submission document.\n\nVisually analyze the binary file provided with extreme accuracy. Pay close attention to tables, reproducing them EXACTLY as they appear, character-by-character.\n\nCRITICAL: Do not paraphrase, interpret, or \"fill in\" text. If you cannot read something clearly, state \"text unclear\" rather than guessing. Transcribe field labels and values exactly as written.\n\nIf the requirements being validated require certain content to be present, look closely for it and provide all rele