{"level":30,"time":1776974020301,"pid":123,"hostname":"844f2260-bff","step":"review-runs","item":"16.md","index":2,"runIndex":"run-1","documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNum":9,"prompt":"Looking at the site plan drawing (Block 2 on Sheet 9), please identify and describe:\n\n1. The location of any trash receptacles, dumpster enclosures, or trash collection areas shown on the plan\n2. Describe where these facilities are located relative to the site boundaries and adjacent property lines\n3. Identify which adjacent properties are closest to any trash facilities\n4. Note the measurements or distances if shown on the plan between trash facilities and property lines\n5. Are there any notes on the site plan indicating trash/dumpster screening or setback requirements?\n\nPlease be very specific about where trash facilities are located on the drawing (e.g., \"northeast corner,\" \"south side near buildings,\" etc.).","res":{"steps":[{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on a detailed visual analysis of the provided site plan document, here is the information regarding trash facilities:\n\n**1. Location of trash receptacles, dumpster enclosures, or trash collection areas shown on the plan:**\nAfter a thorough examination of the site plan drawing (the visual map portion of the document), there are **no** designated trash receptacles, dumpster enclosures, or specific central trash collection areas physically drawn or labeled anywhere on the site layout. \n\n**2. Location of facilities relative to site boundaries:**\nBecause no physical trash facilities are drawn on the plan, a physical location relative to boundaries cannot be determined from this drawing.\n\n**3. Adjacent properties closest to trash facilities:**\nNot applicable, as no physical trash facilities are shown on the drawing. \n\n**4. Measurements or distances between trash facilities and property lines:**\nNot applicable, as no physical trash facilities are shown on the drawing.\n\n**5. Notes on the site plan indicating trash/dumpster screening or setback requirements:**\nThere are no notes regarding physical dumpster screening or physical setbacks for enclosures. However, there is a specific text box located in the lower-middle section of the document that explains how trash collection will be handled (which explains the absence of a drawn dumpster). \n\nUnder the exact heading **Trash Collection Notes**, the following is stated character-by-character:\n\n> \"Trash containers shall not be left at curbside unattended. Signs must be posted on the building or at a location that is publicly visible indicating that trash containers may not be left at curbside. The sign shall indicate the City of Austin's Code enforcement phone number for the public to report violations.\"\n> \"A restrictive covenant may be required for enforcement purposes.\"\n> \"Reference: TCM, 9.4.2\"\n\n*Note for the reviewer: The absence of drawn central dumpsters and the specific wording of the \"Trash Collection Notes\" strongly indicate this development utilizes individual roll-away bins for each unit rather than a centralized commercial dumpster enclosure requiring screening or setbacks.*","providerMetadata":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}],"finishReason":"stop","usage":{"inputTokens":1455,"outputTokens":413,"totalTokens":3245,"reasoningTokens":1377},"warnings":[],"request":{"body":{"prompt":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"file","mediaType":"image/jpeg","data":"[BINARY_DATA_REMOVED - length: 2702484]"},{"type":"text","text":"# Your task\n\nYou are analyzing a subset of a real estate development site plan submission document.\n\nVisually analyze the binary file provided with extreme accuracy. Pay close attention to tables, reproducing them EXACTLY as they appear, character-by-character.\n\nCRITICAL: Do not paraphrase, interpret, or \"fill in\" text. If you cannot read something clearly, state \"text unclear\" rather than guessing. Transcribe field labels and values exactly as written.\n\nIf the requirements being validated require certain content to be present, look closely for it and provide all relevant information that pertains to the broader request. Remember that you are only looking at a single supplementary document, or a single page from the primary site plan. Just because you do not find evidence for a requirement on this page does not mean it will not be present on another page.\n\nReport back precisely on what you see, using exact quotes for any text you transcribe from forms, tables, or labels.\n\nThe final review agent will not be able to look at this document directly, so you must be their eyes. Ensure you describe everything relevant in full detail with perfect accuracy.\n"},{"type":"text","text":"Looking at the site plan drawing (Block 2 on Sheet 9), please identify and describe:\n\n1. The location of any trash receptacles, dumpster enclosures, or trash collection areas shown on the plan\n2. Describe where these facilities are located relative to the site boundaries and adjacent property lines\n3. Identify which adjacent properties are closest to any trash facilities\n4. Note the measurements or distances if shown on the plan between trash facilities and property lines\n5. Are there any notes on the site plan indicating trash/dumpster screening or setback requirements?\n\nPlease be very specific about where trash facilities are located on the drawing (e.g., \"northeast corner,\" \"south side near buildings,\" etc.)."}]}],"headers":{"user-agent":"ai/5.0.152"}}},"response":{"id":"aitxt-LQVVUxHqs6juI6hdROh7mBYR","timestamp":{},"modelId":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","headers":{"access-control-allow-headers":"Content-Type, Authorization, ai-gateway-auth-method, ai-gateway-protocol-version, ai-model-id, ai-language-model-id, ai-language-model-specification-version, ai-image-model-specification-version, ai-embedding-model-specification-version, ai-language-model-streaming, ai-reporting-tags, ai-reporting-user, http-refere