 Pad\".\n\n**2. Dimensions or Clearances**\nNo, there are no dimensions or clearance distances drawn, labeled, or visibly indicated between any of the identified transformer pads and the nearby buildings or structures.\n\n**3. Building Types or Construction Materials**\n*   **Building Types:** The structures near the pads are identified as multi-unit buildings labeled \"Bldg. 1\" through \"Bldg. 8\", which are further subdivided into individual units (e.g., \"Unit 102\", \"Unit 201\"). The title block in the bottom right corner identifies the project as \"Valley View Townhomes\", indicating residential townhome construction.\n*   **Construction Materials:** There are no explicit labels or notations on this specific drawing calling out the construction materials (e.g., brick, wood framing, stucco) for the buildings themselves. \n\n**4. Notations Regarding Clearance Requirements**\nNo, there are no notations visible on this drawing regarding transformer pad clearance requirements per Austin Energy Design Criteria. I have reviewed all text blocks, including the \"Utility Notes\" in the bottom right and the general \"Note\" in the bottom left, and none contain references to Austin Energy Design Criteria or transformer clearances.","providerMetadata":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}],"finishReason":"stop","usage":{"inputTokens":1415,"outputTokens":524,"totalTokens":4408,"reasoningTokens":2469},"warnings":[],"request":{"body":{"prompt":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"file","mediaType":"image/jpeg","data":"[BINARY_DATA_REMOVED - length: 2092056]"},{"type":"text","text":"# Your task\n\nYou are analyzing a subset of a real estate development site plan submission document.\n\nVisually analyze the binary file provided with extreme accuracy. Pay close attention to tables, reproducing them EXACTLY as they appear, character-by-character.\n\nCRITICAL: Do not paraphrase, interpret, or \"fill in\" text. If you cannot read something clearly, state \"text unclear\" rather than 