{"level":30,"time":1776974070295,"pid":123,"hostname":"844f2260-bff","step":"review-runs","item":"15.md","index":3,"runIndex":"run-1","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01LqK2ZxSKzpux9B4WeMtuTX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on my detailed research, I now have sufficient information to evaluate the checklist items. Let me compile my findings.\n\n## Research Summary\n\n**Key Findings from Site Plan Review:**\n\n1. **Zoning and Applicability:**\n   - Site zoned MF-2 (Multi-Family Residence — Medium Density)\n   - Adjacent SF-3 parcel (immediate neighbor) triggers NEW Article 10 compatibility standards\n   - Site plan submitted May 20, 2025 (after July 15, 2024 effective date of new Article 10)\n   - New Article 10 applies: site is MF-4-or-less-restrictive zoning within 75 feet of triggering property\n\n2. **Setback Lines and Documentation:**\n   - **Sheet 9 (Site Plan)**: NO setback lines labeled or dimensioned on the main site plan\n   - **Sheet 4 (Survey)**: Shows easements but NO recorded building setback lines on the original plat\n   - **Sheet 2 (Plat)**: Shows no recorded setback lines or building restriction lines\n   - **No compatibility exhibit sheet** in the 39-sheet plan set\n   - **No compatibility cross-section sheets** showing height limits vs. distance\n\n3. **Transformer Pads:**\n   - **Sheet 21 (Electrical)**: Five transformer pads identified but with NO clearance dimensions shown\n   - NO notes referencing Austin Energy Design Criteria 1.10.4\n   - NO clearance distances (5 ft, 10 ft, 12 ft, etc.) labeled on the plan\n\n4. **Through-Lot Status:**\n   - Single street frontage on Valley View Road only\n   - Not a through lot\n\n5. **Waterfront Overlay, LA District, Hazardous Pipeline:**\n   - No WO designation\n   - Not in LA district\n   - Not in hazardous pipeline zone\n   - These items do NOT apply\n\nNow let me evaluate each checklist item:"}],"stop_reason":null,