istance from the south adjacent property (SF-3). Distance from SF-5 or more restrictive zoning (20 feet required) cannot be verified without specific dumpster location callout."},{"deficiencyId":"ZLU-16.35","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["General Site Plan Notes (Compatibility)"],"applicableAreas":["Exterior lighting locations above second floor"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Fixture locations and heights for all exterior lighting are not shown on the site plan. Sheet 9 Block 1 states exterior lighting will comply with Subchapter E 2.5 and notes that 'any change or substitution of lamps/light fixtures shall be submitted to the Director for approval,' indicating fixture details are deferred to building plan review. Specific verification that no lighting above second floor faces residential property cannot be made from the site plan."},{"deficiencyId":"ZLU-16.37","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["LDC § 25-2-1063(B); General Site Plan Notes (Compatibility)"],"applicableAreas":["Mechanical equipment locations and noise levels"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No mechanical equipment schedule, noise ratings, or equipment location specifications are provided on the site plan. Equipment noise levels (required to be ≤70 dB(A) at property lines adjacent to residential) cannot be verified without a detailed mechanical equipment schedule showing equipment types, locations, and manufacturer noise ratings."}]},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"b56d4c09-bd1a-47e8-b311-49b45186f601"}
