oject Location Map\n\n*A scaled map indicating the project boundaries, showing the project location relative to the surrounding street network.*\n\n# Project Location Map\n\n[Map displaying the project site highlighted in red, situated between Valley View Rd and Clawson Rd. Adjacent and nearby streets include Manchaca, Fleetwood Dr, Romford Dr, Prather Ln, Winfield Cv, Russell Dr, Southridge Dr, Fort View Rd, Gathright Cv, Bert Ave, and Highway 290.]\n\n**PROJECT LOCATION**\n\n0 500' 1000'\nScale 1\\\" = 500'\n\n**BLEYL ENGINEERING**\nPLANNING • DESIGN • MANAGEMENT\n12007 Technology Blvd, Ste 150, Austin TX 78727\nTexas Firm Registration No. F-678 \nTel. 512-454-2400 \nwww.bleylengineering.com\n\nAUSTIN   BRYAN   CONROE   HOUSTON\n\nH:\\\\Jobfiles\\\\RJ3 (RJ3 Building Group)\\\\RJ3 70496 (Valley View Townhomes SP)\\\\04 CAD\\\\Plot Sheets\\\\Cover.dwg 4/4/2025 1:50 PM\n","numLines":24,"startLine":1,"totalLines":24}}}
