{"level":30,"time":1776974102383,"pid":123,"hostname":"844f2260-bff","step":"review-runs","item":"15.md","index":6,"runIndex":"run-2","documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNum":1,"prompt":"Examine the cover sheet and identify: (1) What is the application submission date? (2) Are there any notes about zoning setback requirements or compatibility standards listed on the cover sheet? (3) Does the cover sheet cite LDC § 25-2-1051 or any Article 10 compatibility standards? (4) Are there any waivers, variances, or relief mechanisms noted? (5) What is the engineer's seal date?","res":{"steps":[{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on a detailed visual analysis of the provided site plan cover sheet, here are the answers to your questions:\n\n**(1) What is the application submission date?**\nThe application submission date is prominently displayed in the center of the sheet under the SP number as: **\"Submittal Date: May 20, 2025\"**. Additionally, in the \"SITE PLAN APPROVAL\" block in the lower right area, it is listed as **\"APPLICATION DATE 05/20/2025\"**.\n\n**(2) Are there any notes about zoning setback requirements or compatibility standards listed on the cover sheet?**\nNo, there are no notes, tables, or text blocks on this cover sheet detailing specific zoning setback requirements or compatibility standards. The only references to zoning are \"Zoning Case No. C14-2013-0093\" (in the Site Development Data block) and \"ZONING: MF-2\" (in the SITE PLAN APPROVAL block). \n\n**(3) Does the cover sheet cite LDC § 25-2-1051 or any Article 10 compatibility standards?**\nNo, there are no citations or references to LDC § 25-2-1051 or Article 10 compatibility standards anywhere on this cover sheet. (Note: Subchapter E, Article 3 is cited regarding Commercial Design Standards in the notes on the left).\n\n**(4) Are there any waivers, variances, or relief mechanisms noted?**\nYes, there is one waiver noted in the bottom-left corner of the sheet. The text reads exactly:\n> \"DCM Waiver Note: On 01/21/2026 this project received approval from the Watershed Protection Department of a waiver to Section 1.2.4.E.1.a.l of the COA Drainage Criteria Manual.\"\n\n**(5) What is the engineer's seal date?**\nThe engineer's seal date is **\"2/27/26\"**. This date is written immediately below the digital seal for Jason K. Rodgers (Registered Professional Engineer, Texas 87881) in both the top right corner and the bottom right corner of the document.","providerMetadata":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}],"finishReason":"stop","usage":{"inputTokens":1406,"outputTokens":469,"totalTokens":3685,"reasoningTokens":1810},"warnings":[],"request":{"body":{"prompt":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"file","mediaType":"image/jpeg","data":"[BINARY_DATA_REMOVED - length: 2370268]"},{"type":"text","text":"# Your task\n\nYou are analyzing a subset of a real estate development site plan submission document.\n\nVisually analyze the binary file provided with extreme accuracy. Pay close attention to tables, reproducing them EXACTLY as they appear, character-by-character.\n\nCRITICAL: Do not paraphrase, interpret, or \"fill in\" text. If you cannot read something clearly, state \"text unclear\" rather than guessing. Transcribe field labels and values exactly as written.\n\nIf the requirements being validated require certain content to be present, look closely for it and provide all relevant information that pertains to the broader request. Remember that you are only looking at a single supplementary document, or a single page from the primary site plan. Just because you do not find evidence for a requirement on this page does not mean it will not be present on another page.\n\nReport back precisely on what you see, using exact quotes for any text you transcribe from forms, tables, or labels.\n\nThe final review agent will not be able to look at this document directly, so you must be their eyes. Ensure you describe everything relevant in full detail with perfect accuracy.\n"},{"type":"text","text":"Examine the cover sheet and identify: (1) What is the application submission date? (2) Are there any notes about zoning setback requirements or compatibility standards listed on the cover sheet? (3) Does the cover sheet cite LDC § 25-2-1051 or any Article 10 compatibility standards? (4) Are there any waivers, variances, or relief mechanisms noted? (5) What is the engineer's seal date?"}]}],"headers":{"user-agent":"ai/5.0.152"}}},"response":{"id":"aitxt-9x2ziJ5yWVhQr94im1Xv4G3M","timestamp":{},"modelId":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","headers":{"access-control-allow-headers":"Content-Type, Authorization, ai-gateway-auth-method, ai-gateway-protocol-version, ai-model-id, ai-language-model-id, ai-language-model-specification-version, ai-image-model-specification-version, ai-embedding-model-specification-version, ai-language-model-streaming, ai-reporting-tags, ai-reporting-user, http-referer, x-title, anthropic-beta","access-control-allow-methods":"GET, POST, PUT, PATCH, DELETE, OPTIONS","access-control-allow-origin":"*","cache-control":"public, max-age=0, must-revalidate","content-encoding":"br","content-type":"application/json","date":"Thu, 23 Apr 2026 19:55:02 GMT","server":"Vercel","strict-transport-security":"max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload","transfer-encoding":"chunked","vary":"rsc, next-router-state-tree, next-router-prefetch, next-router-segment-prefetch","x-matched-path":"/v1/ai/language-model","x-vercel-cache":"MISS","x-vercel-id":"iad1::iad1::wtztq-1776974069024-d303ef7413a9"},"body":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on a detailed visual analysis of the provided site plan cover sheet, here are the answers to your questions:\n\n**(1) What is the application submission date?**\nThe application submission date is prominently displayed in the center of the sheet under the SP number as: **\"Submittal Date: May 20, 2025\"**. Additionally, in the \"SITE PLAN APPROVAL\" block in the lower right area