{"level":30,"time":1776974111056,"pid":123,"hostname":"844f2260-bff","step":"review-runs","item":"32.md","index":4,"runIndex":"run-2","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012Zc9VsMceupM9anMhsbQXT","type":"tool_result","content":"20:## Block 4: notes — Notes regarding accessibility standards and requirements for the project, covering topics such as accessible parking, route cross-slopes, and ramp design.\n23:1. Approval of these plans by the City of Austin indicates compliance with applicable City regulations only. Compliance with accessibility standards such as the 2010 Standards for Accessible Design or the 2012 Texas Accessibility Standards was not verified. The applicant is responsible for compliance with all applicable accessibility standards.\n26:4. Slopes on accessible routes may not exceed 1:20 unless designed as a ramp.\n29:## Block 5: notes — A list of notes related to the release of the site plan, covering topics such as compliance with the approved plan, necessary permits, signage, easements, utility service, demolition, condominium regulations, driveway construction, and right-of-way excavation.\n33:c. All signs must comply with requirements of the Land Development Code (Chapter 25-10).\n46:## Block 7: notes — Notes detailing regulations for trash collection on the property, including rules against leaving containers at the curbside unattended and the requirement for visible signage.\n49:Trash containers shall not be left at curb side unattended. Signs must be posted on the building or at a location that is publicly visible indicating that trash containers may not be left at curbside. The sign shall indicate the City of Austin's Code enforcement phone number for the public to report violations."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4e7b1c1f-9804-4a61-b82e-41dbab740236","uuid":"9efe282d-08eb-4806-814b-379254ba1f10","tool_use_result":{"mode":"content","numFiles":0,"filenames":[],"content":"20:## Block 4: notes — Notes regarding accessibility standards and requirements for the project, covering topics such as accessible parking, route cross-slopes, and ramp design.\n23:1. Approval of these plans by the City of Austin indicates compliance with applicable City regulations only. Compliance with accessibility standards such as the 2010 Standards for Accessible Design or the 2012 Texas Accessibility Standards was not verified. The applicant is responsible for compliance with all applicable accessibility standards.\n26:4. Slopes on accessible routes may not exceed 1:20 unless designed as a ramp.\n29:## Block 5: notes — A list of notes related to the release of the site plan, covering topics such as compliance with the approved plan, necessary permits, signage, easements, utility service, demolition, condominium regulations, driveway construction, and right-of-way excavation.\n33:c. All signs must comply with requirements of the Land Development Code (Chapter 25-10).\n46:## Block 7: notes — Notes detailing regulations for trash collection on the property, including rules against leaving containers at the curbside unattended and the requirement for visible signage.\n49:Trash containers shall not be left at curb side unattended. Signs must be posted on the building or at a location that is publicly visible indicating that trash containers may not be left at curbside. The sign shall indicate the City of Austin's Code enforcement phone number for the public to report violations.","numLines":7}}
{"level":30,"time":1776974114596,"pid":123,"hostname":"844f2260-bff","step":"review-runs","item":"16.md","index":2,"runIndex":"run-1","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01AepJWTtvY3agA5FowaKHAt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on my comprehensive review of the site plan documentation, let me now compile my findings. I'll evaluate each checklist item systematically.\n\n**EVALUATION SUMMARY:**\n\nThe site is zoned **MF-2** (Multi-Family Low Density) and is immediately adjacent to an SF-3 parcel and other residential/office properties. Importantly, **Article 10 does not apply** to this site because MF-2 is more restrictive than MF-4 (the threshold for Article 10 applicability). Therefore, all Article 10–specific items (ZLU-16.14–16.26) are N/A.\n\nHowever, many checklist items apply to all sites or have general applicability. Here are my findings for items that are **fail** or **not-verifiable**:\n\n## Fail and Not-Verifiable Findings:\n\n**ZLU-16.1 – Adjoining land uses not noted for all sides:**\n- East side: Land uses ARE labeled (Existing Apartment Building, Clarion Ridge Condominiums)\n- North side: Only zoning labeled (MF-4-CO); no land use type specified\n- South side: Faint/unclear labeling; no specific land use type\n- West side: No land use labels\n- Deficiency: Adjacent land uses are not documented on all four sides as required.\n\n**ZLU-16.2 – Adjoining land uses across streets not shown:**\n- South side properties across Valley View Road have faint text but no clear land use designations\n- Cannot verify from drawing\n\n**ZLU-16.4 – Adjacent property zoning not shown:**\n- North: MF-4-CO is labeled\n- East: MF-2-CO is labeled\n- South: No zoning labeled\n- West: No zoning labeled\n- Deficiency: Adjacent zoning missing for south and west boundaries\n\n**ZLU-16.5 – Adjacent zoning inconsistent with GIS:**\n- Site plan shows MF-4-CO on north boundary\n- Facts.md (reflecting GIS data) lists adjacent parcels as SF-3, GO, MF-3, MF-3-CO, MF-2-CO\n- MF-4-CO is not listed in facts.md adjacent properties; discrepancy noted\n- Possible inconsistency with current zoning records\n\n**ZLU-16.6 – Zoning boundary lines not shown/labeled:**\n- Site abuts multiple zoning districts (subject MF-2 adjacent to SF-3, GO, MF-3, MF-3-CO, MF-2-CO)\n- Only N and E boundaries show zoning; S and W boundaries have no zoning callouts\n- No indication of which sheets show each boundary\n\n**ZLU-16.8 – Zoning designations not included on mylars:**\n- Recorded plat (Sheet 2) does not include zoning information\n- Zoning shown only on engineered site plan (Sheet 9), and only partially (N and E sides)\n\n**ZLU-16.9 – Existing building footprints within 50 feet not shown:**\n- East: Footprints shown (Existing Apartment Building, Clarion Ridge Condominiums)\n- North: No existing building footprints shown; SF-3 parcel is immediate neighbor with structures\n- South: No building footprints shown (mostly street)\n- West: No building footprints shown; other residential/office properties adjoin\n- Deficiency: Existing buildings on adjacent properties not documented for all boundaries\n\n**ZLU-16.30 – Parking screening height not verified:**\n- Site is MF-2 residential with 88 parking spaces (>10 spaces); adjoins residential properties (SF-3, MF-3, MF-3-CO, MF-2-CO)\n- Wooden privacy fence shown on landscape plan along property lines\n- **No fence height is specified** on the landscape plan or elsewhere\n- Cannot verify compliance with 6-foot minimum height requirement\n\n**ZLU-16.35 – Lighting above second floor potentially facing residential:**\n- Buildings have up to 3 stories; site plan specifies \"full cut-off and fully shielded\" fixtures per Subchapter E 2.5\n- General Site Plan Notes require no exterior lighting above second floor adjacent to residential\n- Site plan does not explicitly state that fixtures above second floor are prohibited\n- Cannot verify from available plans\n\n**ZLU-16.37 – Mechanical equipment noise:**\n- No mechanical equipment schedule or noise specifications provided on site plan\n- General requirement for all sites with equipment adjacent to residential\n- Cannot verify 70 dB(A) compliance\n\nNow I'll return the structured output with only the fail and not-verifiable findings:"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2382,"cache_read_input_tokens":73064,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2382,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"158c3787-95dd-4091-81cc-891db6165072","uuid":"ce51840b-1f7c-4493-b41f-2279bafa74d4"}
{"level":30,"time":1776974127645,"pid":123,"hostname":"844f2260-bff","step":"review-runs","item":"16.md","index":2,"runIndex":"run-1","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01AepJWTtvY3agA5FowaKHAt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01KkpuyL1h1tJfhdCdMuNMQt","name":"StructuredOutput","input":{"grouping":"16","findings":[{"deficiencyId":"ZLU-16.1","status":"fail","codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":["all surrounding properties","north","south","west"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Adjacent land uses are not documented on all four sides of the site. East boundary shows labels for Existing Apartment Building and Clarion Ridge Condominiums, but north, south, and west boundaries lack specific land use designations. All four sides must be labeled."},{"deficiencyId":"ZLU-16.2","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":["adjacent properties across Valley View Road"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Adjoining properties across adjacent streets and rights-of-way (particularly south, across Valley View Road) are not clearly labeled with specific land use designations on the site plan."},{"deficiencyId":"ZLU-16.4","status":"fail","codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":["south","west"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Adjacent zoning designations are not shown for all property boundaries. North and east boundaries show zoning (MF-4-CO and MF-2-CO respectively), but south and west boundaries lack zoning designations despite being adjacent to other zoning districts."},{"deficiencyId":"ZLU-16.5","status":"fail","codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":["north boundary"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[{"documentId":"63cead15-41f8-418c-b0ef-bd5c2b44719a","label":"facts.md"}],"comment":"Site plan shows MF-4-CO zoning on the north boundary, but facts.md (based on current GIS records) does not list MF-4-CO among the adjacent properties. Adjacent properties are documented as SF-3, GO, MF-3, MF-3-CO, and MF-2-CO. Zoning designations shown on site plan may be inaccurate or inconsistent with current City GIS zoning records."},{"deficiencyId":"ZLU-16.6","status":"fail","codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":["north","south","west boundaries"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Site abuts multiple zoning districts but zoning boundary lines are not shown or labeled for all boundaries. Zoning is partially labeled on the north and east boundaries only. Sheets where each zoning boundary is depicted are not identified."},{"deficiencyId":"ZLU-16.8","status":"fail","codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":["entire site"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":2},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Zoning designations are not included on the mylars (recorded plat, Sheet 2). The plat shows only legal boundaries and easements without zoning information. Zoning is shown only on the engineered site plan (Sheet 9), and even there only partially (north and east boundaries only)."},{"deficiencyId":"ZLU-16.9","status":"fail","codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":["north","south","west boundaries"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[{"documentId":"63cead15-41f8-418c-b0ef-bd5c2b44719a","label":"facts.md"}],"comment":"Existing building footprints on adjoining properties within 50 feet of the site are shown only on the east boundary (Existing Apartment Building and Clarion Ridge Condominiums). No existing building footprints are shown for adjacent properties to the north, south, or west, despite the SF-3 parcel (north) being an immediate neighbor with structures, and other residential/office properties adjoining the site."},{"deficiencyId":"ZLU-16.30","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["LDC § 25-6-563(B)"],"applicableAreas":["parking areas","east, north, south boundaries"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":31}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Off-street parking consists of 88 spaces (10 surface + 78 garage) in a residential district adjoining other residential-district properties. The landscape plan shows a wooden privacy fence along property boundaries and parking buffer trees, but fence height is not specified. Cannot verify compliance with the 6-foot minimum height requirement for parking screening adjacent to residential properties. Provide fence height specifications."},{"deficiencyId":"ZLU-16.35","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["General Site Plan Notes (Compatibility)"],"applicableAreas":["building elevations","all buildings"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Buildings have up to 3 stories. Site plan specifies that exterior lighting will be 'full cut-off and fully shielded in compliance with Subchapter E 2.5,' but does not explicitly state whether any fixtures are located above the second floor facing adjacent residential properties. General Site Plan Notes require no lighting above the second floor adjacent to residential property. Provide explicit confirmation that no exterior lighting is installed above the second floor facing residential properties."},{"deficiencyId":"ZLU-16.37","status":"not-veri