ome units\" in 8 buildings (4-Plex, 5-Plex, 6-Plex)\n   - Site plan shows single Lot 1 from Mecey Subdivision (1975)\n   - **No townhouse lot subdivision created** as required by LDC § 25-2-775\n   - Each townhouse requires separate townhouse lot with private yard\n\n6. **Signage Compliance:**\n   - General sign note included: \"All signs must comply with requirements of the Land Development Code (Chapter 25-10)\"\n   - **Missing:** Specific note for Nonconforming Signs Ordinance area (§ 25-10-152)\n\n7. **Transit Proximity:**\n   - No documentation of multifamily transit proximity per LDC § 25-1-703(B)(4)\n   - No evidence of waiver from director\n   - Cannot verify compliance"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1850,"cache_read_input_tokens":84594,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1850,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4e7b1c1f-9804-4a61-b82e-41dbab740236","uuid":"4d78c2d2-ca59-4307-88fd-efac1281157f"}
