{"level":30,"time":1776974152317,"pid":123,"hostname":"844f2260-bff","step":"review-runs","item":"16.md","index":8,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_012Bc2YHLYZBdBBGb7MXN8UC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on my comprehensive review of the site plan documents, I'll now evaluate each checklist item in grouping 16. Let me first summarize my research findings:\n\n## Research Summary\n\n**Site Characteristics:**\n- **Zoning:** MF-2 (Multi-Family Low Density) — more restrictive than MF-4\n- **Use:** 39 multi-family townhome units\n- **Adjacent Properties & Zoning:**\n  - East: Chateaux Ridge Condominiums (MF-2-CO) with existing apartment buildings shown\n  - North: MF-4-CO zoning labeled, no buildings within 50 ft shown\n  - South: \"William John Tinnin, Jr.\" property referenced, no zoning label shown, no buildings within 50 ft shown\n  - West: Valley View Road (Local Street, principal street)\n  - Also adjacent per facts.md: SF-3, GO, MF-3, MF-3-CO\n\n**Article 10 Applicability:**\nThe site is zoned MF-2, which is **more restrictive than MF-4**. Per LDC § 25-2-1051, Article 10 applies only to sites zoned MF-4 or **less restrictive** (meaning MF-4, MF-5, MF-6, commercial, industrial). Therefore, **Article 10 does NOT apply** to this site. However, adjacent SF-3 property exists, which triggers the applicability condition for item 16.14.\n\n**Documented on Site Plan (Sheet 9):**\n- ✓ Some adjacent land uses labeled (East: Chateaux Ridge Condominiums)\n- ✓ Some adjacent zoning labeled (East: MF-2-CO; North: MF-4-CO)\n- ✓ Existing buildings shown on East (Chateaux Ridge)\n- ✓ Building dimensions documented in tables\n- ✓ Exterior lighting requirement noted (full cut-off, fully shielded per Subchapter E 2.5)\n- ✓ Parking data provided (10 surface, 78 garage)\n- ✓ Retaining walls shown on south/east boundaries\n\n**NOT Documented:**\n- ✗ Adjacent zoning for South and West